      "statement": "The SchedulerGatekeeper facet inherits its workspace scope from the containing Overseer facet (its ctx.id is the parent workspace id, smoke-checked against the account id), so callers cannot supply an account or workspace id; it describes as scheduler://tasks with suggested binding name SCHEDULER and publishes ScheduleSession/ScheduledTaskHook types.",
