    {
      "id": "claim_b94ef2232e6149bea242308a6f84701c",
      "statement": "One ScheduleDriver Durable Object per account (addressed getByName(accountId)) runs all of the account's schedules under one alarm: each pass persists state before crossing an RPC boundary, processes at most 20 due schedules with 4 concurrent deliveries, and arms an immediate continuation when a backlog remains — a design whose documented tradeoff is that one never-settling user callback can delay other schedules in the account.",
