    {
      "id": "claim_55cad76c49d642d3bd2b5645210bdf70",
      "statement": "Authorization or callback failures retry up to eight total attempts with exponential backoff starting at one minute and capped at one hour, after which the schedule is 'dead' (Needs attention); a rejected startHook skips the occurrence without consuming an attempt, and the Workshop admission check runs before every attempt so a disallowed hook/gatekeeper/account skips without consuming callback budget.",
