      "id": "claim_a16fe04ae87f46b0b5bdae0566f74716",
      "statement": "Crash recovery uses a 5-minute lease (RECOVERY_DELAY_MS): a run left pending by a dead activation is re-prepared transactionally with a fresh lease, and a delivery-stage pending record found by the next pass is failed as callback_failed rather than replayed.",
