      "statement": "Blueprint-created workspaces deliberately do not inherit schedules (they must register callbacks and receive fresh enablement), and the scheduler's limits are fixed policy: 500 rows per account, 100 per workspace, 100 per management page, 20 due schedules per alarm pass, 4 concurrent deliveries, 8 callback attempts, 200-char titles, 2000-char descriptions.",
